SUMMARY:Monarch Madness
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the incredible monarch butterfly migration with hands-on learning\, garden exploration\, and family fun! This special event combines science education with creative activities for butterfly enthusiasts of all ages. \nEvent Highlights\n🔬 Monarch Butterfly Education\n\nMigration Mysteries: Discover how monarchs navigate 3\,000 miles to Mexico\nLifecycle Learning: From tiny eggs to magnificent butterflies\nConservation Connection: Why monarchs need our help to survive\n\n🏷️ Hands-On Tagging Experience\n\nLive Demonstration: Watch experts safely tag monarch butterflies\nInteractive Workshops: Learn the science behind butterfly tagging\nResearch Connection: Understand how tagging data helps conservation\n\n🌿 Meet the Milkweed\n\nGuided Garden Tours: Explore Lorrimer’s beautiful butterfly gardens\nPlant Detective Work: Identify native milkweed species\nHabitat Heroes: Learn how to create monarch-friendly spaces\n\n🎨 Children’s Activities\n\nCreative Crafts: Make butterfly-themed keepsakes\nStory Time: Engaging tales of monarch adventures\nButterfly Costume Parade: Show off your wings and join the celebration!\n\nPerfect for Families!\nThis event is designed with families in mind\, offering: \n\nActivities for all ages and skill levels\nEducational content that’s both fun and informative\nHands-on experiences that create lasting memories\nBeautiful outdoor setting in historic Lorrimer Sanctuary\n\nCOST: FREE  \nCANCELLATION: NJ Audubon’s programs require a minimum number of registrants to run. If we cancel\, due to lack of participation\, severe weather\, or unforeseen circumstances\, all participants will be notified as soon as possible and are eligible for a full refund. Participants may cancel without penalty if greater than 48 hours in advance. Sorry\, no refund for cancellations less than 48 hours in advance unless due to health emergencies; however\, registrations can be transferred to another program in the future. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/monarch-madness-2/
LOCATION:Lorrimer Sanctuary\, 790 Ewing Avenue\, Franklin Lakes\, NJ\, 07417\, United States
CATEGORIES:Family Program,Lorrimer Sanctuary,Monarchs
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://njaudubon.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Monarch-Madness-2026.webp
GEO:40.9924503;-74.1992136
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Lorrimer Sanctuary 790 Ewing Avenue Franklin Lakes NJ 07417 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=790 Ewing Avenue:geo:-74.1992136,40.9924503
END:VEVENT
